### accessMode: authenticated-session
### selectionGuidance: source-derived-ergon-chefia-contract
### note: Source-derived Ergon Showcase contract (localhost:8080), not deployed on the public Quickstart host. Filters VagaFuncao by parent sector (setorPai) and hierarchical path prefix (caminhoHierarquicoPrefixo) for occupied leadership positions (ERGadm00163 / ERGadm00480).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@sessionCookie = replace-with-ERGONSESSION-cookie-value
@xsrfToken = replace-with-XSRF-TOKEN-cookie-value
@orgao = 2

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ergon/vagas-funcao/filter
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: ERGONSESSION={{sessionCookie}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrfToken}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}
X-Tenant: {{orgao}}

< ../../payloads/hr/ergon_chefia_vagas_funcao_filter_hierarquia.json
